WEBVTT

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:02.136
and as we parted ways and he drove off,

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.896
he said, "But he could still come!"

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.056
(Laughter)

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:11.656
He had assumed
full ownership of this project

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.496
and was not willing to relinquish it,

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.440
even to me, its author.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:18.240
That, for me, was success.

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:25.816
I wish I could tell you that this project
transformed the neighborhood

00:11:25.840 --> 00:11:28.736
and all the indices
that we like to rely on:

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:34.016
increased jobs,
reduced crime, no alcoholism --